					</h2>
					<div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-600 rounded-full"></div>
				</div>

				<!-- Description -->
				<div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
					<p class="sr-reveal" style="--sr-delay:0ms">
					I'm <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Krish Ray</strong>, a passionate Software Engineer pursuing B.Tech in Computer Science at Manipal University Jaipur (CGPA: 8.84/10.0). With hands-on international internship experience in Robotics, AI/ML, and Full-Stack Development, I specialize in building production-grade autonomous systems and intelligent applications.
					</p>
					<p class="sr-reveal" style="--sr-delay:120ms">
					My expertise spans <strong class="text-blue-600">Python</strong>, <strong class="text-green-600">ROS2</strong>, <strong class="text-orange-600">FastAPI</strong>, <strong class="text-purple-600">Django</strong>, and <strong class="text-indigo-600">LangGraph</strong>. I've built end-to-end solutions including autonomous mobile manipulators, real-time perception systems, and agentic AI orchestrators. I'm passionate about edge AI, deep learning, and creating systems that solve complex real-world problems.
					</p>
					<p class="sr-reveal" style="--sr-delay:240ms">
					Currently exploring TinyML and federated learning through the ACM India Winter School on Edge AI. I'm committed to pushing the boundaries of autonomous systems, computer vision, and intelligent automation to create impactful technology.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Stats -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
				<div class="text-center sr-card" style="--sr-delay:0ms" data-target="20">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 counter">0</div>
